Now EmbargoService — the core. Write in two segments. Segment 1: package, imports, class doc, fields, constructor, setEmbargoes + validation helpers. Segment 2: release, queries, fingerprint/replay helpers, response builders, outcome records, closing brace.

Key logic for setEmbargoes:

```java
@Transactional
public EmbargoBatchOutcome setEmbargoes(SetEmbargoBatchRequest request) {
    List<NormalizedItem> items = normalize(request.items());  // sorted by observationId, scope normalized
    String fingerprint = fingerprint("EMBARGO_SET", request.operator(), itemsJson(items));
    EmbargoBatchOutcome replayed = checkReplay(request.requestId(), fingerprint);
    if (replayed != null) return replayed;
    EmbargoBatchOutcome concurrent = insertPlaceholder(request.requestId(), fingerprint);
    if (concurrent != null) return concurrent;

    List<ErrorDetail> errors = new ArrayList<>();
    boolean alreadySetConflict = false;
    Map<String, ObservationSnapshot> currents = new LinkedHashMap<>();
    Set<String> seen = new LinkedHashSet<>();
    for (NormalizedItem item : items) {
        if (!seen.add(item.observationId())) {
            errors.add(detail(item, "DUPLICATE_OBSERVATION", ...)); continue;
        }
        Optional<ObservationSnapshot> current = observationRepository.findCurrentForUpdate(item.observationId());
        if (current.isEmpty()) { errors.add(OBSERVATION_NOT_FOUND); continue; }
        currents.put(id, current.get());
        if (current.deleted()) { errors.add(OBSERVATION_DELETED); continue; }
        if (embargoRepository.find(id).isPresent()) { errors.add(EMBARGO_ALREADY_SET); alreadySet=true; continue; }
        Instant createdAt = observationRepository.findCreatedAt(id).orElseThrow(...);
        if (item.embargoUntilUtc().isBefore(createdAt)) { errors.add(EMBARGO_BEFORE_CREATION with actual/required/diff); continue; }
        if (item.scope().isEmpty()) { errors.add(EMPTY_DISCLOSURE_SCOPE); continue; }
        Optional<OpenConflictRecord> oc = openConflictRepository.find(id);
        if (oc.isPresent()) { errors.add(UNRESOLVED_CONFLICT); continue; }
    }
    if (!errors.isEmpty()) {
        if (anyReason EMBARGO_ALREADY_SET) throw conflict("...", errors);
        throw unprocessable("...", errors);
    }
    Instant setAt = Instant.now(clock);
